      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWITCH ON (6) lightly raced filly who backed up the good first-up performance with a courageous Maiden win over 1400m at Kembla Grange from the tricky gate. Looks to have further upside and gets her chance to run the trip from the low draw. OURAGAN (4) win record hardly excites and comes here deep into the prep. Lone win came at this track and doesn't have to improve much to win this. Held her ground to the line for a close-up second in similar grade at this track over 1500m. Genuine top three contender. RIBBLE LACE (3) has come back in great shape and is due for a change of luck. Just over three weeks between runs when he peaked late to finish third over 1500m at this track. Gets a cheap lead and no excuses today. C'MON FLYER (1) lightly raced gelding with ability. Has needed the two runs back and is ready for the mile and further now. Stays in the calculations.",
